<div class="text-center mb-5">
    <h2 class="display-4">High-Performance Solutions</h2>
    <p class="lead mx-auto" style="max-width: 800px;">
        We've designed our Managed solution to proactively maintain Servers, Workstations and
        Network Devices. By delivering regular maintenance, monitoring, management, unlimited
        remediation, help desk and emergency support, we are able to drastically reduce downtime.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 800px;">
        All fully managed services are delivered by our 24/7 Network Operations Centre and are
        designed to reduce the likelihood and impact of an unwanted technology failure while
        resolving any identified issues, for a fixed monthly price. Having the information on
        hand, provided through our comprehensive reporting, allows you to make informed decisions
        about your network.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 800px;">
        The reports pulled from our proactive monitoring provide the framework to allow for
        accurate planning and forecasting, ensuring optimal performance. We currently run at
        <strong>98% uptime</strong> on all our fully Managed Networks and continue to bridge the
        gap between IT and business.
    </p>
</div>

